  <!-- =================== Focus 01: the music mixer =================== -->
  <section class="section hq-focus">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="hq-head">
        <span class="section-label">Focus 01 // Music</span>
        <h2 class="section-title">Hear <span class="accent">every world.</span></h2>
        <p class="section-sub">
          Each song is written so the instruments can change without changing the tune. Every
          world gets its own arrangement, and they all play in sync, so switching worlds never
