            </button>
            <div class="hq-mixer__title">
              <span class="hq-mixer__kicker">Song</span>
              <span data-song-title aria-live="polite">Hive</span>
            </div>
            <button type="button" class="hq-round" data-song-next aria-label="Next song">
              <svg aria-hidden="true" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M9 5l7 7-7 7" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="3" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg>
            </button>
          </div>

          <button type="button" class="btn btn--primary hq-mixer__play" data-play data-state="paused" aria-label="Play the music">
            <svg class="hq-mixer__icon-play" aria-hidden="true" width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M7 4.5v15l12.5-7.5z" fill="currentColor"/></svg>
            <svg class="hq-mixer__icon-pause" aria-hidden="true" width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><rect x="5" y="4" width="5" height="16" rx="1" fill="currentColor"/><rect x="14" y="4" width="5" height="16" rx="1" fill="currentColor"/></svg>
            <span data-play-text>Play</span>
          </button>

          <div class="hq-mixer__progress" aria-hidden="true"><div data-progress></div></div>
          <p class="hq-mixer__status" data-status aria-live="polite">Press play, then tap a world.</p>

          <div class="hq-mixer__worlds" role="group" aria-label="World">
            {worlds.map((w, i) => (
              <button
                type="button" class="hq-world" data-world={w.id}
                aria-pressed={i === 0 ? 'true' : 'false'} aria-label={`${w.name} version`}
              >
                <img src={`${A}/tiles/${w.tile}.webp`} alt="" width="40" height="40" loading="lazy">
                <span>{w.name}</span>
              </button>
            ))}
          </div>
        </div>

        <ul class="hq-how">
          <li><strong>Locked together.</strong> All eight arrangements start on the same sample and loop as one.</li>
          <li><strong>One-second crossfade.</strong> Tapping a world runs an equal-power fade, the same curve the mode cards use in the app.</li>
          <li><strong>Nothing loads early.</strong> The music downloads only when you press Play, one song at a time.</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- =================== Focus 02: piece rotation =================== -->
  <section class="section hq-focus">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="hq-head">
